# Push Day
unit: kg
description: Chest, shoulders, and triceps.

Bench Press | reps 4x8 | 60 | rest 1m30s
Shoulder Press (Barbell) | reps 3x10 | 30 | rest 1m
Incline Dumbbell Press | reps 3x10 | 22 | rest 1m30s
Triceps Pushdown | reps 3x12 | 20 | rest 1m
Side Lateral Raise | reps 3x15 | 8 | rest 1m
